    "title": "Wiggle Sort II",
    "workload": "16 passes over one buffer of 1000000 values, each refilling it with a fresh solvable input (even slots from 0..k, odd from k..2k, then a Fisher-Yates shuffle; two LCG steps per draw) with k cycling through 2, 3, 50 and 2500, then wiggle-sorting it in place with the select arm (median-of-three quickselect for the median, then a three-way partition through the virtual index (1 + 2i) % (n | 1)); sink=rolling hash of each pass's wiggle-violation count and a stride-9973 sample of the arrangement",
